# fixtures/hex/store-f/log.2.hex: extent 2 of store F's log (lsns 65,536-131,071). It opens with its extent
# head (chain_in = the trailer of log.1's pad), written by the purge's forced rotation; then the purge's
# delta checkpoint (P-101 step 2), its publish with the retirement of extent 1 (step 7), and a later
# BodyDrop of H2, whose hlc is the greatest of the HLC sequence: HEAD.hlc_seq comes from it ([F05 §10.2]).
# Zero beyond the end of the valid log, 66029 ([F05 §2.4]).

# === group g9 at lsn 65536: the extent head of log.2, written by the forced rotation ([F05 §4.5], §9.28; [F16] P-101 step 1) (durable)
